Package: shieldR
Title: Logistics Chain Simulation under Dynamic Challenges
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller",
    email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Implements a research simulation of a fixed five-leg logistics
    chain with time-varying item specifications, imperfect observations,
    finite transport resources, route-risk learning, and static or adaptive
    disruptions. The package supports reproducible allocation-rule
    comparisons, optional item-condition and processing models, and paired
    disruptions-disabled experiments. It includes synthetic teaching
    scenarios, nonparametric analysis helpers and an optional 'shiny'
    workbench for interactive exploration. The model and its decision
    heuristics require application-specific validation.
